Short:        .fd/pragmas -> asm macros/LVO EQU's
Author:       lynnjenn@vef.north.net (Enchanted Blade Associates)
Uploader:     u9303286 muss cis mcmaster ca (Christopher Jennings)
Type:         dev/misc
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

ConvFP

This is a command line based tool for assembly language programmers and
library developers.  It can perform four functions:

o Extract and display information on a .fd or pragmas file
o Perform syntax checking on a .fd or pragmas file (for lib. developers)
o Convert .fd or pragmas files into an include file LVO equates for the lib.
o Convert .fd or pragmas files into asm macros for the library functions.

Includes exhaustive AmigaGuide documentation, including index, and a simple
installation utility (copies ConvFP command to C:).
